  {
   "text": "Also, while we're here: WHY WOULD I WANT GEMINI TO WRITE THE THING I'M WRITING IN GOOGLE DOCS?? I'm in a literal fucking word processing program. CLEARLY I HAVE MADE THE EXECUTIVE DECISION TO WRITE SOMETHING WITH MY OWN OPPOSALBLE FUCKING THUMBS!",
