   "text": "A family alleges that Google’s Gemini helped their daughter make a suicide plan after she accessed it on a school-issued device.\n \nMeanwhile, Google is forcing schools to keep AI features or lose Search. Schools deserve safeguards, not ultimatums.\n \nGoogle must reverse this policy.",
